@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Authenticated User" as AU
actor Administrator as Admin
actor Lecturer as Lec
actor "Head of Department" as HoD
actor Student as Stu
Admin --|> AU
Lec --|> AU
HoD --|> AU
Stu --|> AU
rectangle "Moderated Learning Management System" {
 usecase "Login" as Login
 usecase "Manage Users" as Users
 usecase "Manage Departments" as Depts
 usecase "Manage Courses" as Courses
 usecase "Assign Lecturer" as Assign
 usecase "Enrol Student" as Enrol
 usecase "Create Assignment" as Create
 usecase "Grant Individual Extension" as Extension
 usecase "View Submissions" as ViewSub
 usecase "Mark Submission" as Mark
 usecase "Submit Assignment" as Submit
 usecase "Late Submission Handling" as Late
 usecase "Resubmit Assignment" as Resubmit
 usecase "View Courses and Assignments" as ViewAssign
 usecase "Moderate Mark" as Moderate
 usecase "Return for Correction" as Return
 usecase "Release Mark" as Release
 usecase "View Released Mark and Feedback" as Results
}
Admin --> Users
Admin --> Depts
Admin --> Courses
Admin --> Assign
Admin --> Enrol
Lec --> Create
Lec --> Extension
Lec --> ViewSub
Lec --> Mark
Stu --> ViewAssign
Stu --> Submit
Stu --> Resubmit
Stu --> Results
HoD --> Moderate
HoD --> Release
Users ..> Login : <<include>>
Depts ..> Login : <<include>>
Courses ..> Login : <<include>>
Assign ..> Login : <<include>>
Enrol ..> Login : <<include>>
Create ..> Login : <<include>>
Extension ..> Login : <<include>>
ViewSub ..> Login : <<include>>
Mark ..> Login : <<include>>
ViewAssign ..> Login : <<include>>
Submit ..> Login : <<include>>
Resubmit ..> Login : <<include>>
Results ..> Login : <<include>>
Moderate ..> Login : <<include>>
Release ..> Login : <<include>>
Late ..> Submit : <<extend>>
Return ..> Moderate : <<extend>>
Resubmit ..> Submit : <<extend>>
@enduml
